<li class="comment odd alt depth-2" id="li-comment-63307"><div id="comment-63307" class="comment clearfix"><div class="comment-t-left"><div class="comment-t-right"><div class="comment-t"></div></div></div><div class="comment-l-left"><div class="comment-l-right"><div class="comment-l"><div class="comment-avatar"><span></span><img alt='' src='http://0.gravatar.com/avatar/690989ba8aec2ed3b4b31343cb774ba6?s=79&amp;d=http%3A%2F%2F0.gravatar.com%2Favatar%2Fad516503a11cd5ca435acc9bb6523536%3Fs%3D79&amp;r=G' class='avatar avatar-79 photo' height='79' width='79' /></div><div class="comment-content"><div class="comment-meta"><div class="comment-author">Brena Caroline Santos Soares</div><div class="comment-date"><time datetime="2014-07-15T23:15:05+00:00">July 15, 2014</time></div></div><div class="comment-entry"><p>Que bacana Eleandra!! Fiquei emocionada ao ler essas linhas.<br />
