<li class="comment byuser comment-author-thais-godinho bypostauthor odd alt depth-2" id="li-comment-63244"><div id="comment-63244" class="comment change clearfix"><div class="comment-t-left"><div class="comment-t-right"><div class="comment-t"></div></div></div><div class="comment-l-left"><div class="comment-l-right"><div class="comment-l"><div class="comment-avatar"><span></span><img alt='Thais Godinho' src='http://vidaorganizada.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/10/Thais-Godinho_avatar_1414670143-79x79.png' class='avatar avatar-79 photo' height='79' width='79' /></div><div class="comment-content"><div class="comment-meta"><div class="comment-author"><a href='http://vidaorganizada.com' rel='external nofollow' class='url'>Thais Godinho</a></div><div class="comment-date"><time datetime="2014-07-14T16:19:52+00:00">July 14, 2014</time></div></div><div class="comment-entry"><p>Mais louco é quem me diz &#8211; e não é feliz. ;D</p>
<a class='comment-reply-link' href='/organizacao/o-que-eu-aprendi-sobre-produtividade-com-tim-ferris-parte-1/6991264961408618585/?replytocom=63244#respond' onclick='return addComment.moveForm("comment-63244", "63244", "respond", "14824")'>Responder</a></div></div><div class="clear"></div></div></div></div><div class="comment-b-left"><div class="comment-b-right"><div class="comment-b"></div></div></div></div></li><!-- #comment-## -->
