<li class="comment odd alt thread-even depth-1" id="li-comment-71576"><div id="comment-71576" class="comment clearfix"><div class="comment-t-left"><div class="comment-t-right"><div class="comment-t"></div></div></div><div class="comment-l-left"><div class="comment-l-right"><div class="comment-l"><div class="comment-avatar"><span></span><img alt='' src='http://1.gravatar.com/avatar/7e02cd542e6be627d6cff08eff14762c?s=79&amp;d=http%3A%2F%2F1.gravatar.com%2Favatar%2Fad516503a11cd5ca435acc9bb6523536%3Fs%3D79&amp;r=G' class='avatar avatar-79 photo' height='79' width='79' /></div><div class="comment-content"><div class="comment-meta"><div class="comment-author">Cláudia Lima</div><div class="comment-date"><time datetime="2014-08-06T08:09:29+00:00">August 6, 2014</time></div></div><div class="comment-entry"><p>Amore, bom dia! </p>
<p>Dá pra me explicar o termo ser proprietário?<br />
Normalmente se entende que o proprietário trabalha mais que o chefe e o empregado.<br />
